{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-workflowctxtextensions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: WorkflowCtx<TExtensions>"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type WorkflowCtx<TExtensions> = Ctx<any, any, TExtensions>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L380","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:380"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Helper alias for typing functions that only care about middleware\nextensions — not the calling workflow's specific input / state\nshape. Common in shared utility helpers:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"async function chargeUser(\nctx: WorkflowCtx<{ user: User }>,\namount: number,\n) {\nreturn ctx.step('charge', () => stripe.charge(amount, ctx.user.id))\n}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For helpers that need typed "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ctx.input"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ctx.state"},{"type":"text","value":", use the\nfull "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Ctx<TInput, TState, TExt>"},{"type":"text","value":" directly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"textensions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TExtensions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TExtensions"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-workflowctxtextensions","text":"Type Alias: WorkflowCtx<TExtensions>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"textensions","text":"TExtensions","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: WorkflowCtx\\<TExtensions\\>\n\n```ts\ntype WorkflowCtx<TExtensions> = Ctx<any, any, TExtensions>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:380](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L380)\n\nHelper alias for typing functions that only care about middleware\nextensions — not the calling workflow's specific input / state\nshape. Common in shared utility helpers:\n\n    async function chargeUser(\n      ctx: WorkflowCtx<{ user: User }>,\n      amount: number,\n    ) {\n      return ctx.step('charge', () => stripe.charge(amount, ctx.user.id))\n    }\n\nFor helpers that need typed `ctx.input` or `ctx.state`, use the\nfull `Ctx<TInput, TState, TExt>` directly.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TExtensions\n\n`TExtensions` = `unknown`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: WorkflowCtx\ntitle: WorkflowCtx\n---\n\n# Type Alias: WorkflowCtx\\<TExtensions\\>\n\n```ts\ntype WorkflowCtx<TExtensions> = Ctx<any, any, TExtensions>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts:380](https://github.com/TanStack/workflow/blob/main/packages/workflow-core/src/types.ts#L380)\n\nHelper alias for typing functions that only care about middleware\nextensions — not the calling workflow's specific input / state\nshape. Common in shared utility helpers:\n\n    async function chargeUser(\n      ctx: WorkflowCtx<{ user: User }>,\n      amount: number,\n    ) {\n      return ctx.step('charge', () => stripe.charge(amount, ctx.user.id))\n    }\n\nFor helpers that need typed `ctx.input` or `ctx.state`, use the\nfull `Ctx<TInput, TState, TExt>` directly.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TExtensions\n\n`TExtensions` = `unknown`\n"}
